8c","event_uuid":"54a6c15a-0a62-447c-ae9e-17ca148d2977","position":{"commit_sha":"3e79f87ebcac39a50e2fbc51e240b13278b43bf3","position":"1787699173144946001-54a6c15a-0a62-447c-ae9e-17ca148d2977"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CI fix (Gerrit 2223 patchset 2): patchset 1's Verified gate failed on the ARG-backlog ratchet test (tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/apply/test_arg_sweep_kwargs_heldout.py::test_arg_backlog_is_substantially_reduced). The new module's coordinate_create() carried an unused keyword-only 'budget_factory' param (accepted 'for parity' with the sibling coordinator), which added the 26th ARG001 unused-arg finding repo-wide, tripping the shrink-only ratchet (assert 26 <= 25). Root cause: a genuinely-unused YAGNI parameter. Fix: removed 'budget_factory' entirely (a create is one-shot; no retry budget is threaded at the create coordinator), updated the two docstrings and the AC6 kw-only-seam assertion. Local: ARG ratchet green, 12/12 coordinator tests green, make lint + typecheck green. Re-pushed; both gates re-running.","timestamp":1787695966816935001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CLOSED CERTIFIED (no force). Gerrit change 2223 patchset 2 merged (LLM-Review+1 PASS + Verified+1 green after the ARG-ratchet fix). Re-ran plan-review to clear a stale-material file_impact drift (6->2 paths) -> certified; completion verifier PASSed. New module create_coordinator.py + 12 held-out tests landed on main. Unblocked S4 T2 (1cb3).","timestamp":1787699173144946001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787028296100424001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c5c0717d-2868-4050-96ff-c1d7244a540d","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"00e8-37a3-6f1d-4381"},{"link_uuid":"ca514414-b953-431e-ad4a-104704c554a1","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"007c-fb13-0308-4b42"}],"description":"## Context\nCreate can leave a real Jira issue without durable local identity. The coordinator must preserve write-ahead pending state and must never blind-replay an ambiguous create.\n\n## Outcome\nCoordinate the pre-create pending lifecycle intent and one budgeted Cloud/DC create call. A pending-save failure makes zero provider calls; ambiguous completion re-observes only through replay-safe identity/query seams or defers.\n\n## Plan\n1. Execute the versioned pending-binding intent durably before any create call. Return item-scoped persistence failure on save error.\n2. Call create once through the shared logical budget. Do not wrap the compound legacy create path.\n3. On timeout/connection loss, search only by replay-safe identity/query evidence. Return recovered success when the exact issue is proven; otherwise retain pending state and defer.\n4. Record returned Jira key immediately in the typed outcome for downstream containment; never delete a successful remote issue.\n5. Implement Cloud/DC failure cuts before save, during create, and immediately after key return.\n\n## Testing\nStateful fakes assert local bytes, provider call counts, known-key outcome, ambiguity, and no remote delete.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Failed pending save produces zero Jira calls and an item-scoped persistence outcome.\n- [x] One physical create invocation issues exactly one provider create call.\n- [x] Timeout/connection loss never blind-replays.\n- [x] Exact replay-safe observation may recover success; inconclusive observation retains pending state and defers.\n- [x] A returned Jira key is preserved in every later failure outcome.\n- [x] No failure path deletes a successfully created Jira issue.\n\n## Out of scope\nLabel/property containment, local confirmation, restart convergence, and family cutover.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/create_coordinator.py","reason":"new leaf create-coordination primitive: durable pending-save before create, one budgeted create call, replay-safe timeout observation, typed CreateOutcome carrying the returned key"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_coordinator.py","reason":"held-out TDD: Cloud/DC stateful fakes covering the six ACs (zero-call pending-save failure, exactly-one create call, no blind-replay, observe-recover vs inconclusive-defer, key preserved, no remote delete)"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339"],["relates_to","007c-fb13-0308-4b42"],["relates_to","00e8-37a3-6f1d-4381"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339","parent_status_uuid":"1023c3d4-8f30-4070-97de-e5f482a1d05a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["rp03","create","reconciler","tdd"],"ticket_id":"d04c-c184-0b00-4a8a","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S4 T1 — Coordinate durable pending intent and one create attempt","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_outbound_create_binding.py -k \"pending or create_call or ambiguous or known_key or no_delete\"","dd_id":"AC1-AC6","dd_text":"Pending durability, one create, ambiguity, key retention, and no remote deletion"}]},"source_event_uuids":["43799fb0-0200-469b-a235-86699a4265c0","316d8c64-68d